{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-158109-r4517539","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Green Chicken Curry with Coconut Milk","sourcePageId":158109,"sourceRevision":"4517539","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T02:43:10Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Green%20Chicken%20Curry%20with%20Coconut%20Milk&oldid=4517539","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:35.000Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Pan fried recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for curry","Category:Recipes using chicken","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using coconut milk","Category:Recipes using coriander","Category:Recipes using fish sauce","Category:Recipes using fresh ginger","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using green bell pepper","Category:Recipes using leek","Category:Recipes using lemongrass","Category:Recipes using salt","Category:Thai recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"418c5128a138727cf674288e750857a08b9a94970753279460b45684456ac129","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Stew recipes|servings=4–6|time=60 minutes|difficulty=2\n}}\n__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Thailand|Thai recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Vietnam|Vietnamese recipes]]\n\nServe this hearty dish with rice. \n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Curry paste ===\n\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] dried [[Cookbook:Coriander|coriander]] seeds\n* 1 tbsp black [[Cookbook:Peppercorn|peppercorns]]\n* [[Cookbook:Chiles|Chiles]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] fresh [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cilantro|Fresh coriander]]\n* 2 big cloves of [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 3 tbsp [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n* 1–5 pieces of [[Cookbook:Lemongrass|lemongrass]], coarsely cut\n\n=== Curry ===\n* [[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|Oil]] for frying\n* 3–4 big [[Cookbook:Leek|leeks]], coarsely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 green [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|bell peppers]]\n* 1–2 cans of [[Cookbook:Coconut Milk|coconut milk]]\n* [[Cookbook:Garlic|Garlic]]\n* [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|Soy sauce]]\n* 850 g [[Cookbook:Cube|cubed]] [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]] meat\n* [[Cookbook:Basil|Basil]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Fish Sauce|fish sauce]] (optional)\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Grind all the ingredients for the curry paste together with a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar and pestle]].\n# [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] the curry paste with oil for a couple of minutes in a big pot. Add leeks and bell pepper. Shortly after, add the coconut milk, cover, and let [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] 20–30 minutes.\n# Meanwhile, crush garlic into a bowl with some soy sauce and mix in the chicken meat cubes. Let marinate.\n# Fry the marinated meat with oil.\n# Add the cooked meat to the curry pot, then season with basil, salt, and fish sauce to taste.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes for curry]]\n[[Category:Pan fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Thai recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green bell pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coriander]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using leek]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemongrass]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Green Chicken Curry with Coconut Milk","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 tbsp dried coriander seeds","sourceText":"2 tbsp dried coriander seeds","amountText":"2 tbsp dried coriander seeds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tbsp black peppercorns","sourceText":"1 tbsp black peppercorns","amountText":"1 tbsp black peppercorns","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Chiles","sourceText":"Chiles","amountText":"Chiles","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 cm fresh ginger","sourceText":"2 cm fresh ginger","amountText":"2 cm fresh ginger","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Fresh coriander","sourceText":"Fresh coriander","amountText":"Fresh coriander","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 big cloves of garlic","sourceText":"2 big cloves of garlic","amountText":"2 big cloves of garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"3 tbsp chopped onion","sourceText":"3 tbsp chopped onion","amountText":"3 tbsp chopped onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1–5 pieces of lemongrass, coarsely cut","sourceText":"1–5 pieces of lemongrass, coarsely cut","amountText":"1–5 pieces of lemongrass, coarsely cut","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"Oil for frying","sourceText":"Oil for frying","amountText":"Oil for frying","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"3–4 big leeks, coarsely chopped","sourceText":"3–4 big leeks, coarsely chopped","amountTex